  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK Weltehungerhilfe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal management control Weltehungerhilfe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med uppdraget &#xe4;r att bed&#xf6;ma systemet f&#xf6;r intern kontroll av Welterhunger hilfe. Konsulten f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas identifiera eventuella svagheter. Baserat p&#xe5; resultaten kommer Sida att kr&#xe4;va att Welterhungerhilfe hanterar svagheterna i f&#xf6;rekommande fall f&#xf6;re eller under avtalsfasen. Vissa av &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rderna kan ing&#xe5; i takt med att avtalsvillkoren f&#xf6;ljs upp under den &#xe5;rliga revisionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is to assess the system for internal control of Welterhunger hilfe. The consultant is expected to identify any weaknesses. Based on the results, Sida will require Welterhungerhilfe to deal with the weaknesses, if any, before or during the contract phase. Some of the measures may be included as the terms of the agreement are followed up during the annual audit.</narrative>
  </description>
